,"blurb":"19 waterfalls in 2 miles of stone stairs and tunnels. The famous one.","town":"Watkins Glen","indoor":false,"drive":"45 min from Ithaca","url":"https://parks.ny.gov/parks/142/"},{"name":"Cascadilla Gorge Trail","blurb":"Six waterfalls climbing from downtown Ithaca up to Cornell. Short and steep.","town":"Ithaca","indoor":false,"drive":"in town","url":"https://cornellbotanicgardens.org/our-gardens/natural-areas/cascadilla-gorge/"},{"name":"Ithaca Farmers Market","blurb":"Waterfront pavilion at Steamboat Landing. Sat 9-3, Sun 10-3. Food stalls, not just produce.","town":"Ithaca","indoor":false,"drive":"in town","url":"https://ithacamarket.com/"},{"name":"Cornell Botanic Gardens","blurb":"Free. Herb garden, arboretum, and the Slim Jim Woods trails.","town":"Ithaca","indoor":false,"drive":"in town","url":"https://cornellbotanicgardens.org/"},{"name":"Stewart Park","blurb":"Cayuga Lake shoreline, carousel, big shade trees. Easy with no plan.","town":"Ithaca","indoor":false,"drive":"in town","url":"https://www.cityofithaca.org/234/Stewart-Park"},{"name":"Lime Hollow Nature Center","blurb":"Boardwalks, bog, treehouse. Closest real nature to the Airbnb.","town":"Cortland","indoor":false,"drive":"10 min from Cortland","url":"https://limehollow.org/"},{"name":"Greek Peak Mountain Coaster","blurb":"Alpine coaster you control. Also a zipline and adventure center.","town":"Cortland","indoor":false,"drive":"15 min from Cortland","url":"https://www.greekpeak.net/"},{"name":"Cayuga Lake Wine Trail","blurb":"Tasting rooms up both shores. Sheldrake Point and Six Mile Creek are the easy picks.","town":"Cayuga Lake","indoor":false,"drive":"20-50 min","url":"https://cayugawinetrail.com/"},{"name":"Museum of the Earth","blurb":"Full mastodon and a right whale skeleton. Good rain plan, about 2 hours.","town":"Ithaca","indoor":true,"drive":"30 min from Cortland","url":"https://www.museumoftheearth.org/"},{"name":"Herbert F. Johnson Museum of Art","blurb":"Free. I.M. Pei building, and the 5th floor has the best view of Cayuga Lake.","town":"Ithaca","indoor":true,"drive":"in Cornell campus","url":"https://museum.cornell.edu/"},{"name":"Sciencenter","blurb":"Hands-on science museum. Built for kids but the outdoor mini golf is fun regardless.","town":"Ithaca","indoor":true,"drive":"in town","url":"https://www.sciencenter.org/"},{"name":"Center Ithaca / Ithaca Commons","blurb":"Food court with the soup dumplings, plus the pedestrian mall shops.","town":"Ithaca","indoor":true,"drive":"in town","url":"https://www.downtownithaca.com/"},{"name":"Cortland Beer Company","blurb":"Small taproom downtown Cortland. Closest good beer to the Airbnb.","town":"Cortland","indoor":true,"drive":"5 min from Airbnb","url":"https://www.cortlandbeer.com/"},{"name":"1890 House Museum","blurb":"Chateau-style mansion with a tower you can climb. Right in Cortland.","town":"Cortland","indoor":true,"drive":"5 min from Airbnb","url":"https://www.the1890house.org/"},{"name":"Cortland Repertory Theatre","blurb":"Summer stock at the Pavilion in Little York Lake. Check what is running.","town":"Cortland","indoor":true,"drive":"15 min from Airbnb","url":"https://www.cortlandrep.org/"}],"links":[{"label":"Waterfalls","url":"https://www.reddit.com/r/ithaca/comments/nq3a5m/waterfalls_outside_ithaca_that_dont_require_much/"},{"label":"Food","url":"https://www.reddit.com/r/ithaca/comments/1k683oo/best_food_for_out_of_towners_ex_locals/"}],"photos":["photo-20260816-141042-4nwbwq.jpg","photo-20260815-185114-7tqjd0.jpg","photo-20260815-175418-9uy4cz.jpg","photo-20260815-155043-vp56kk.jpg","photo-20260815-152307-jfanyi.jpg","photo-20260815-152258-8okys2.jpg","photo-20260815-141024-o5oyeh.jpg","photo-20260815-141008-968dfx.jpg","photo-20260814-125428-rbnxnu.jpg","photo-20260814-125426-xdncf9.jpg","photo-20260814-125426-le7ngh.jpg","photo-20260814-125426-a96kxg.jpg","photo-20260814-125426-7w1hh6.jpg","photo-20260814-125426-20zjdj.jpg","photo-20260814-122242-15kcce.jpg","photo-20260812-021602-mmvj0t.jpg","photo-20260812-015849-6d0tv0.jpg","photo-20250816-181708-gpirdb.jpg","photo-20250816-145335-i6i8tj.jpg","photo-20220805-194748-llg4sv.jpg","photo-20220805-191207-l5o81a.jpg","photo-20220805-134813-z06hak.jpg"],"stay":[{"label":"Address","value":"2016 Alpha Circle, Unit 15D\nCortland, NY 13045","url":"","long":false},{"label":"Listing","value":"https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1181330297215578370","url":"https://www.airbnb.com/rooms/1181330297215578370","long":false},{"label":"Host Contact","value":"Lyza Feint\n607-220-9044\nlyza.nicole@live.com","url":"","long":false},{"label":"Check In","value":"Thu, 8/13 @ 3pm","url":"","long":false},{"label":"Check Out","value":"Sun, 8/16 @ 11am","url":"","long":false},{"label":"Check In Instructions","value":"Key located inside lockbox, on front door. Code: 0150","url":"","long":false},{"label":"Check Out Instructions","value":"- Check out 11 AM\n\nPrior to your departure, please tidy up the property by doing the following:\nRemove all perishable items\nTake out the trash\nWash and put away all used dishes\nStrip linens from all used beds\nPlace all used linens in a pile\nPlace a load of used towels in the washer and start the first load of laundry\nTurn off all lights, electronics, and appliances\nClose and lock all windows and doors\nReturn key to the lockbox\nAdditional fees will be imposed if the property is found in an unsatisfactory condition, so please return it to the condition in which you found it","url":"","long":true},{"label":"Ammeneties","value":"PARKING: Driveway (2 vehicles), free street parking (first-come, first-served)\n\nKITCHEN: \n - refrigerator, stove/oven, dishwasher, dishware/flatware, \n  - cooking basics, spices, \n - single-serve coffee maker & drip coffee maker (coffee not provided), blender, \n - crockpot, microwave, toaster\n\nGENERAL: \n - free WiFi\n - central heating, window A/C unit \n - linens/towels, iron/board, laundry detergent, trash bags, paper towels, hair dryer, complimenta